- <i>Is it her?</i>

186
00:12:31.167 --> 00:12:32.292
<i>It's Hye-sun. right?</i>

187
00:12:32.417 --> 00:12:34.209
But how...

188
00:12:34.876 --> 00:12:38.209
<i>I think she's selling herself. no?</i>

189
00:12:38.334 --> 00:12:40.459
