190
00:12:40.584 --> 00:12:42.751
- <i>Hey. calm down.</i>
- Hello?

191
00:12:42.876 --> 00:12:44.251
<i>Calm down. Suk-kyu.</i>

192
00:12:57.917 --> 00:13:01.126
This is bad. really bad.

193
00:13:07.792 --> 00:13:10.209
Buddy. get out!

194
00:13:10.667 --> 00:13:14.376
