"So high and mighty?"

208
00:13:53.709 --> 00:13:56.126
Which district is he from?

209
00:13:56.251 --> 00:13:58.709
Who cares? Drink.

210
00:13:58.834 --> 00:14:01.001
STATION PHARMACY

211
00:14:01.459 --> 00:14:04.001
Excuse me...

212
00:14:07.917 --> 00:14:09.501
